# Essential Commands

Task: Prepare a collaborative directory for the project group `{{group_name}}`. The group and the users `{{user_a}}` and `{{user_b}}` already exist on the system.

1. Add the users `{{user_a}}` and `{{user_b}}` to the group `{{group_name}}` (as a supplementary group).
2. Create the directory `{{share_dir}}` with group ownership set to `{{group_name}}`.
3. Set the permissions of `{{share_dir}}` to mode `{{dir_mode}}`: owner and group have full access, others have no access, and new files created inside must inherit the group `{{group_name}}` (setgid).

Do not change the primary group of either user.
